svg><div class="chapter-text reveal"><p class="chapter-time">11:40 pm</p><h3 class="chapter-title">The house is asleep</h3><p class="chapter-body">Behind the kitchen cabinet, the compression joint on a 20-year-old supply pipe has started to weep.</p></div></li><li class="chapter chapter-2"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 90" class="vignette" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="120" height="90" rx="14" fill="#13213c"></rect><path d="M20 40h70" stroke="#c6d2e5" stroke-width="3"></path><rect x="26" y="41" width="58" height="30" fill="#0b1528" stroke="#c6d2e5" stroke-width="2"></rect><path d="M84 56H50v-14" stroke="var(--sc-pipe)" stroke-width="4"></path><path d="m62 51-2 3 3 2-2 3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M61 61c1.4 2 2.3 3.1 2.3 4.2a2.3 2.3 0 0 1-4.6 0c0-1.1.9-2.2 2.3-4.2z" fill="#7cc4ff"></path><ellipse cx="54" cy="76" rx="36" ry="4" fill="#7cc4ff" fill-opacity=".55"></ellipse></svg><div class="chapter-text reveal"><p class="chapter-time">11:41 pm</p><h3 class="chapter-title">A drip under the kitchen sink</h3><p class="chapter-body">By the time someone comes down for a glass of water, there&#39;s a puddle in front of the cabinet.</p></div></li><li class="chapter chapter-3"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 90" class="vignette" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="120" height="90" rx="14" fill="#13213c"></rect><rect x="12" y="22" width="44" height="40" rx="6" fill="#fff"></rect><rect x="18" y="28" width="32" height="6" rx="2" fill="#e4e0d7"></rect><rect x="18" y="38" width="32" height="6" rx="2" fill="#e4e0d7"></rect><rect x="18" y="49" width="32" height="8" rx="2.5" fill="var(--accent)"></rect><path d="M54 50c12-24 22-28 30-22" stroke="#ffd27a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></path><rect x="80" y="14" width="28" height="62" rx="6" fill="#2b4f86" stroke="#3b4c70" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><rect x="83" y="28" width="22" height="16" rx="3" fill="#fff"></rect><circle cx="84" cy="27" r="3.5" fill="#ffd27a"></circle></svg><div class="chapter-text reveal"><p class="chapter-time">11:43 pm</p><h3 class="chapter-title">One form, sent from a phone</h3><p class="chapter-body">Name, number and what&#39;s wrong. It reaches our on-call plumber&#39;s phone within seconds, with the address attached.</p></div></li><li class="chapter chapter-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 90" class="vignette" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="120" height="90" rx="14" fill="#13213c"></rect><rect y="58" width="120" height="20" fill="#060e1c"></rect><path d="M118 68H22" stroke="var(--sc-pipe)" stroke-width="3"></path><rect x="58" y="38" width="44" height="26" rx="4" fill="#f4f6fa"></rect><path d="M58 44H48l-8 10v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16z" fill="#f4f6fa"></path><rect x="40" y="56" width="62" height="3" fill="var(--accent)"></rect><circle cx="50" cy="66" r="5" fill="#060e1c" stroke="#c6d2e5" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="90" cy="66" r="5" fill="#060e1c" stroke="#c6d2e5" stroke-width="2"></circle><path d="M18 66c-3-3.5-5-5.6-5-8a5 5 0 0 1 10 0c0 2.4-2 4.5-5 8z" fill="var(--sc-pipe)"></path></svg><div class="chapter-text reveal"><p class="chapter-time">11:48 pm</p><h3 class="chapter-title">A van leaves Quarry Hill</h3><p class="chapter-body">The plumber texts an arrival time of 25 minutes. Common fittings are already on the van, so there&#39;s no stop at a supplier.</p></div></li><li class="chapter chapter-5"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 90" class="vignette" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="120" height="90" rx="14" fill="#13213c"></rect><rect x="12" y="16" width="56" height="48" rx="7" fill="#fff"></rect><text x="20" y="34" class="vg-t vg-small">Fixed price</text><text x="20" y="54" class="vg-t vg-price">$149</text><path d="M74 66h20v-24" stroke="var(--sc-pipe)" stroke-width="4"></path><path d="M94 66h18" stroke="var(--sc-pipe-new)" stroke-width="4"></path><path d="M92.6 18.2a4 4 0 0 0-4.7 5.2l-3.9 3.8a1.6 1.6 0 0 0 2.2 2.2l3.8-3.9a4 4 0 0 0 5.2-4.7l-2.4 2.4-2.1-.5-.5-2.1z" fill="#0b1528" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"></path></svg><div class="chapter-text reveal"><p class="chapter-time">12:15 am</p><h3 class="chapter-title">Price first, then the repair</h3><p class="chapter-body">We show you the failed joint and agree $149 before starting. Old fitting out, new section of pipe in, water back on.</p></div></li><li class="chapter chapter-6"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 90" class="vignette" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="120" height="90" rx="14" fill="#13213c"></rect><circle cx="60" cy="36" r="17" stroke="#12b76a" stroke-width="3"></circle><path d="m52 36.5 5 5 10-10.5" stroke="#12b76a" stroke-width="3.5"></path><path transform="translate(36 70) scale(.55)" d="M0-9 2.6-3.2 9-2.8 4.1 1.3 5.6 7.6 0 4.2-5.6 7.6-4.1 1.3-9-2.8-2.6-3.2z" fill="#f59e0b"></path><path transform="translate(48 70) scale(.55)" d="M0-9 2.6-3.2 9-2.8 4.1 1.3 5.6 7.6 0 4.2-5.6 7.6-4.1 1.3-9-2.8-2.6-3.2z" fill="#f59e0b"></path><path transform="translate(60 70) scale(.55)" d="M0-9 2.6-3.2 9-2.8 4.1 1.3 5.6 7.6 0 4.2-5.6 7.6-4.1 1.3-9-2.8-2.6-3.2z" fill="#f59e0b"></path><path transform="translate(72 70) scale(.55)" d="M0-9 2.6-3.2 9-2.8 4.1 1.3 5.6 7.6 0 4.2-5.6 7.6-4.1 1.3-9-2.8-2.6-3.2z" fill="#f59e0b"></path><path transform="translate(84 70) scale(.55)" d="M0-9 2.6-3.2 9-2.8 4.1 1.3 5.6 7.6 0 4.2-5.6 7.6-4.1 1.3-9-2.8-2.6-3.2z" fill="#f59e0b"></path></svg><div class="chapter-text reveal"><p class="chapter-time">12:50 am</p><h3 class="chapter-title">Dry floor, two-year guarantee</h3><p class="chapter-body">We pressure-test the joint, dry out the cabinet and email the invoice. If that joint leaks within two years, we fix it free.</p><a href="#quote" class="btn btn-primary mt-7 whitespace-normal">Send us your problem <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon icon-shift" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></li></ol></div></div></section>
